{"results":[{"id":"69f1fa3e73a0897558593b04","name":"Phoenix Rising: Exposing the PhaaS Kit Behind Global Mass Phishing Campaigns","description":"Since January 2025, researchers identified over 2,500 phishing domains targeting more than 70 organizations across financial services, telecommunications, and logistics sectors globally. Two dominant smishing campaigns were discovered: Reward Points phishing impersonating banks and telecom providers, and Failed Parcel Delivery phishing mimicking logistics companies. Despite different themes, both campaigns share infrastructure and utilize the Phoenix System administrative panel, a successor to the Mouse System. This Phishing-as-a-Service platform offers real-time victim monitoring, geofencing, IP-based filtering, and live-phishing interventions to bypass multi-factor authentication. The platform is distributed via Telegram channels for approximately $2,000 annually, providing threat actors with pre-built templates, traffic filtering mechanisms, and real-time victim management dashboards. Attackers potentially leverage fake Base Transceiver Stations to bypass carrier-level filtering and deliver messages app...","author_name":"AlienVault","modified":"2026-06-03T10:07:17.997000","created":"2026-04-29T12:31:58.118000","revision":2,"tlp":"white","public":1,"adversary":"","indicators":[{"id":4333936724,"indicator":"http:\/\/154.91.90.0","type":"URL","created":"2026-05-04T10:30:23","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":4333936725,"indicator":"http:\/\/38.162.114.0","type":"URL","created":"2026-05-04T10:30:23","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":4333936726,"indicator":"http:\/\/43.133.0.0","type":"URL","created":"2026-05-04T10:30:23","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":4333936727,"indicator":"http:\/\/43.134.0.0","type":"URL","created":"2026-05-04T10:30:23","content":