ure with JavaScript-to-native bridge, allowing attackers to dynamically modify behavior without recompiling. Distribution occurs through hundreds of Google-verified advertisements controlled by shell companies including AdsParkPro LTD and Advantage Web Marketing LLC. The campaign primarily targets Anglophone and Western European markets. All samples were signed with valid Apple Developer IDs and successfully passed notarization, achieving zero detections on VirusTotal initially. The malware hijacks Google Chrome browsers, redirecting traffic ...","author_name":"AlienVault","modified":"2026-06-03T09:29:46.870000","created":"2026-06-02T14:33:49.817000","revision":2,"tlp":"white","public":1,"adversary":"CL-CRI-1089","indicators":[{"id":4389934768,"indicator":"atsheisdomestic.org","type":"domain","created":"2026-06-02T14:33:50","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":4389934769,"indicator":"etoftheappyrince.org","type":"domain","created":"2026-06-02T14:33:50","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":4389934770,"indicator":"healightejustb.org","type":"domain","created":"2026-06-02T14:33:50","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":4389934771,"indicator":"sinterfumesco.com","type":"domain","created":"2026-06-02T14:33:50","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":4390164723,"indicator":"021666417de8b9972c179783fe60d4c4ad2d93224e3a0f16137065c960b1b845","type":"FileHash-SHA256","created":"2026-06-02T14:33:50","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":4390164724,"indicator":"30448686ec900d5213d74f08f0d2b7924c5336a29445b2a434aba8d8b19d7530","type":"FileHash-SHA256","created":"2026-06-02T14:33:50","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":4390164725,"indicator":"363923500ce942bf1