vaScript loaders to harvest GitHub Actions secrets, npm tokens, cloud credentials (AWS, Azure, GCP), Kubernetes and Vault material, SSH keys, Git credentials, and cryptocurrency wallet files. The payload can daemonize on developer workstations, includes Russian-locale avoidance mechanisms, and exfiltrates stolen data through encrypted HTTPS channels with GitHub API fallback mechanisms. The campaign employs tactics similar to the publicly released Shai-Hulud toolkit, though attribution remains unclear due to the availability of open-source attack tooling.","author_name":"AlienVault","modified":"2026-06-02T09:20:56.597000","created":"2026-06-01T19:31:26.541000","revision":2,"tlp":"white","public":1,"adversary":"","indicators":[{"id":4389548603,"indicator":"2bec18af5f0f9cbe8949cc2bf5466dc6","type":"FileHash-MD5","created":"2026-06-01T19:31:27","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":4389548604,"indicator":"d07ec47042a05fe3d684f72d2155d180","type":"FileHash-MD5","created":"2026-06-01T19:31:27","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":4389548605,"indicator":"0dc06ecdaa63fe24859cfd955053c23245c536e4733480239d14bebf12688e35","type":"FileHash-SHA256","created":"2026-06-01T19:31:27","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":4389548606,"indicator":"21b6409a7b84446310daca5409ad6112ac60a1e4bef97736e53fff5f63bfdef4","type":"FileHash-SHA256","created":"2026-06-01T19:31:27","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":4389548607,"indicator":"88896d478986d453f5da79b311de39d9b4b1bea95c21af1d8ef181b0f4e52fe9","type":"FileHash-SHA256","created":"2026-06-01T19:31:27","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":4389548608,"indicator":"ac2a2208e1726e008be6c73dc0872d9bba163319259dff1b62055ac933ca46b6","type":"FileHash-SHA256","created":"2026-06-01T19:31:27","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":4389548609,"indicator":"ee262510cb246d2b904991aee7fc61162bdae34463439ec6383bd5356479d362","type":"FileHash-SHA256","created":"2026-06-01T19:31:27","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null}],"tags":["supply chain attack","npm compromise","ci\/cd targeting","shai-hulud"],"targeted_countries":[],"malware_families":["Shai-Hulud","TrapDoor"],"attack_ids":[],"references":["https:\/\/socket.dev\/blog\/mini-shai-hulud-campaign-hits-red-hat-cloud-services-npm-packages"],"industries":["Technology"],"extract_source":[],"more_indicators":false},{"id":"6a19acf8d896b3c89d4bab6f","name":"Operation Dragon Weave: Uncovering a China-Linked Campaign Targeting Czech Republic and Taiwan Using Azure Cloud C2","description":"A sophisticated cyber-espionage campaign attributed to China-linked actors targets officials and citizens in Czech Republic and Taiwan through spearphishing attacks. The operation deploys malicious ZIP archives containing dual infection paths that ultimately deliver AZUREVEIL, an Adaptix C2 agent. The campaign uniquely leverages Microsoft Azure Blob Storage as a dead-drop command-and-control channel, bypassing traditional C2 infrastructure. A multi-stage infection chain employs RUSTCLOAK, a Rust-based loader implementing triple-layer encryption using modified RC4, Base64, and SM4-CBC algorithms. The final payload supports 36 post-exploitation commands including Beacon Object File execution in memory, file system manipulation, process control, network pivoting, and data exfiltration. Lure documents impersonate official communications from Taiwanese research institutions and Czech Social Security Administration, demonstrating targeted social engineering tailored to each region.","author_name":"AlienVault","modified":"2026-06-01T09:49:14.439000","created":"2026-05-29T15:12:56.411000","revision":2,"tlp":"white","public":1,"ad